WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.980
This is my daughter.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:13.580
And one day... she'll be the greatest artist in the world.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.720
What do you think of Loie?

00:00:17.365 --> 00:00:18.775
Could be my stage name for my dance.

00:00:19.495 --> 00:00:20.495
Your dance.

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.860
The magnificent Loie.

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.620
Forgive me, son. That one is not for you. She's, erm...

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:27.540
Standoffish.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:28.660
Let's drive.

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.445
I'm looking for Miss Loie Fuller.

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:43.960
This is my dance, take it off!

